  "raw": " being Possessed just so that humans can have an easy victory. With the knowledge gained and the massive support of humanity, Possessions are now more powerful than ever before. A curse is now upon the underworld and with it comes evil for its' own sake. Now anyone who's caught in the net can be Possessed, be it human or demon.\n\nWhat does this actually mean? Well... It means that you're now even more likely to win when you're on top.\n\nOn top of that, once you are possessed (even with the bonus of 'bonus possession' of having people around you who are possessed) you now receive all the benefits you had when you were alive, along with increased benefits on your own actions.\n\nExamples of this would be that, while normally the person would have a 40% chance of being possessed as soon as you hit them, now its 50%, and after 20 turns they have a 50% chance of being possessed. The only",
